    "detailed_description": "<strong>THUNDER HELIX</strong> Pilot deadly helicopter gunships, battle enemy forces and complete dangerous missions within a thrilling desert warzone!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Exciting campaign with multiple objectives,<br></li><li>or play randomised scenarios.<br></li><li>Pilot multiple types of helicopter with unique abilities and specifications.<br></li><li>Pick up ammo, fuel and rescue friendlies with the on-board winch.<br></li><li>Missions take place in dawn, day and night-time environments.<br></li><li>Crisp 320 x 200 resolution with 16 or 256 color graphics.<br></li><li>Explosive camels!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flight Control Options:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Game Controller<br></li><li>Flight Joystick<br></li><li>Mouse Flight + Keyboard<br></li><li>or Keyboard Only</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906230/extras/d8b26fa98432f25eb403e71ee1a474f8.avif?t=1739489498\" /></div>",
